WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,080
Xiaoxiao might hurt him, he's so brave

2
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:25,460
I really want to sneak attack my disciple and seek death, so strong!

3
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:32,520
They are all Mozi, so it is impossible not to do so to Your Excellency.

4
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:35,510
We are willing to retreat to the warrior sea

5
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:38,030
With this truce, how can you become stronger?

6
00:00:38,190 --> 00:00:39,470
You can also kill all of my hundreds of thousands of people

7
00:00:40,450 --> 00:00:42,130
Do you really think that Jiandao is the only master?

8
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:43,980
tell you the truth

9
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:45,500
We are just the vanguard

10
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:48,670
There are still millions of troops behind us. If I die,

11
00:00:48,670 --> 00:00:50,030
Jiandao's million-strong army will arrive soon
